<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Corpgro plans share consolidation.</title>
<headline>Corpgro plans share consolidation.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Corpgro said on Wednesday that it planned to consolidate its share capital on the basis of nine ordinary shares into one ordinary share.</p>
<p>&quot;The consolidation has been proposed in order to increase the share price denomination and reduce the number of ordinary shares in issue,&quot; the firm said.</p>
<p>The consolidation, which needs shareholder approval, will take place from August 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
